Package: packui
Source: packui
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Freetime Maker <FreetimeMaker@proton.me>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pyqt6
Description: PyQt6 interface for installed Linux package managers
 PackUI manages packages through locally installed Linux package managers,
 without using store APIs.
